parameters.description:
`problem` (the default) fills in the burn form for any attempt;
`worked` fills in the hardware form for a disc that was written or
verified.

post.description:
# Errors

`VALIDATION_FAILED` for a username, password or role that will not do;
`CONFLICT` for a username already in use.

outcome.description:
`created`; `resubmitted` when an earlier import of it ended without
an artifact; `already_active` when one is still going;
`already_imported` when it is in the library.

credential.description:
The new credential, returned this once. The first request that
presents it makes it the worker's credential and retires the old one;
until then the old one keeps working.
